# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line ending policy
#   Repository stores text as LF; working tree is checked out as CRLF
#   (Windows / MSVC native convention for this project).
#
#   eol=crlf makes this deterministic and independent of the machine-local
#   core.autocrlf setting, so a fresh clone always matches the convention
#   instead of silently falling back to LF.
#
#   Files are still auto-detected: anything containing NUL bytes is treated
#   as binary and never converted.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=crlf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never convert these: the listed files are binary or UTF-16LE, where a
# byte-level EOL rewrite would corrupt the content.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.reg -text
*.lib -text
*.dll -text
*.pdb -text
*.exe -text
*.glb -text
*.hdr -text
*.pdf -text
